<item>
<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones struck near Khartoum, killing four people and damaging a United Nations building, while separate drone attacks hit a residential area and another UN facility in the capital. The RSF also continued ground offensives, attacking aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. Charity kitchens in Khartoum are closing, leaving displaced Sudanese, especially the elderly, in severe hardship. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/chad/core-situation-durgence-au-tchad-mise-jour-des-arrivees-du-soudan-22-nov-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/11/23/widowed-amid-war-and-displacement-sudanese-mothers-struggle-to-survive?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/chad/situation-durgence-au-tchad-i-mise-jour-des-arrivees-du-soudan-22-nov-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/chad/core-emergency-situation-chad-update-arrivals-sudan-22-nov-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/sudan/core-sudan-sudanese-returns-abroad-15-november-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
